cial institutions in North America. As a cornerstone of Canada's banking system, RBC has played a pivotal role in the economic development of Canada, shaping the financial landscape and influencing banking practices across the Americas. With a presence in over 30 countries, it is not only a leader in retail banking but also a significant player in investment banking, wealth management, and insurance, impacting millions of customers and businesses alike.

